  t169: 'A coach that remembers where it hurts',
  t170: 'Check in a sore spot before you run and <b>Runvis remembers it.</b> If the same area keeps flaring up, your next run\'s briefing brings it up first and guides you to hold back.',
  t171: 'Share your badges as a single image',
  t172: 'Turn the badges you\'ve earned into an <b>image card and share it with friends</b>. Your wrist-earned milestones, rendered on-device — no server, no account.'
